The Volkswagen up! 'Move up!' was a mid-range trim level for the Volkswagen up! city car, which was produced from 2011 to 2023. It typically featured the 1.0L three-cylinder petrol engine in either 60 PS or 75 PS variants, paired with a 5-speed manual gearbox. The 'Move up!' trim added features over the base 'Take up!' model, such as body-coloured door mirrors and handles, manual air conditioning, electric front windows, remote central locking, height-adjustable driver's seat, and a 60:40 split-folding rear seat.

